{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>In the land of Egypt.</b> Outside the metropolis — for since even for minor prayer he needed to go outside, as it is written: כצאתי את העיר (Ezekiel 11:23), which is a matter of gravity (דבור חמור) — all the more so. But outside the metropolis it was permitted, because the land of Israel had not yet been chosen for דבור (divine speech), and all lands were fit for דבור. Once it was chosen, they departed [from suitability]. And even though He revealed Himself to Ezekiel outside the land, as it is said: קום צא אל הבקעה (Ezekiel 3:22), it was in the merit of the fathers and in a place of purity over water, like an established river. And likewise we find: ויקם יונה לברוח תרשישה (Jonah 1:3) — he fled outside the land because of דבור. And so before Jerusalem was chosen, all lands were fit for altars; once it was chosen, they departed, as it is said: השמר לך פן תעלה עולותיך וגו׳ (Deut. 12:13). And further, before the eternal house was chosen, the city of Jerusalem was fit for the Shekhinah; once it was chosen, it departed, as it is said: זאת מנוחתי עדי עד (Ps. 132:14). And further, before Aaron was chosen, all Israel were fit for the sacred service; once he was chosen, they departed, as it is said: ולזרעו אחריו ברית כהונת עולם (Num. 25:13). And further, before David was chosen, all Israel were fit for kingship; once he was chosen, they departed, as it is said: ויבחר בדוד וגו׳ (Ps. 78:70), and it is written: הלא לכם לדעת וגו׳ (Jer. 3:13 — etc.)."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {0 "The text appears unvocalized and run-on; I have parsed the chain of arguments by the recurring ועוד ('and further'). The word דבור appears to be used in the technical sense of divine speech/prophecy; I have left it transliterated. The phrase כצאתי את העיר דבור חמור may be read either as a statement ('going out of the city is a grave matter') or as 'דבור חמור' modifying prayer; I have rendered it as a standalone assertion per the plain reading."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:03:01.669547971Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}